MODULE 2: AI PERFORMS NATURAL LANGUAGE PROCESSING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

INTRODUCTION: 

- In this module, you’ll learn how natural language processing (NLP) breaks sentences of human language
    into entities and their relationships, distinguishes between human emotions and sentiment, and
    resolves the meaning of confusing expressions.


LEARNING OBJECTIVES:

